WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.518
With most React libraries,

2
00:00:02.518 --> 00:00:04.340
your team fills in the catalogs.

3
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:09.806
Choose react-i18next for
i18next catalogs and plugins,

4
00:00:09.806 --> 00:00:11.930
Lingui for compiled catalogs,

5
00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:14.089
and React Intl for ICU.

6
00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:18.458
General Translation's gt-react
also generates translations,

7
00:00:18.458 --> 00:00:20.268
from inline JSX.

8
00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:23.949
Wrap the copy in a T component,

9
00:00:23.949 --> 00:00:25.922
so reviewers read it in each diff.

10
00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:30.435
Then npx gt translate writes
every target locale before your

11
00:00:30.435 --> 00:00:30.968
build.

12
00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:33.763
Or keep react-i18next,

13
00:00:33.763 --> 00:00:36.978
and the gt CLI translates
its JSON files.

14
00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:40.331
Your team now ships
Japanese with each release.
